# Coverage: full
# Message:
#   Increased numbers of defenders trained and used in interior cities.
#   Increased the weighting on defenders for nearby hostile units.
#   Improved the AI's assessment of whether or not it's safe to leave a city to kill interlopers.
#   
#   Fixed the bug with governor and expansive workers.
#   Wrote new logic for valuing the cottage-upgrading process when selecting what to work - should now prefer hamlet over cottage and town over village.
#   
#   Improved Cultural AI's war-making habits, in the final stage they'll be very reluctant to declare war and they'll outright refuse to be bribed into war.
# Changed paths (3):
#   M /trunk/CvGameCoreDLL/CvCityAI.cpp
#   M /trunk/CvGameCoreDLL/CvTeamAI.cpp
#   M /trunk/CvGameCoreDLL/CvUnitAI.cpp

